    "companion_document": "UNIQUBE Estimation Engine - Superstructure Logic Specification v1.0",
    "conventions": [
      "All lengths in mm and weights in kg internally; convert mm to m before multiplying by kg_per_m.",
      "P.<id> refers to an entry in parameters; every number is editable, never hard-coded.",
      "Formulas use ceil(), floor(), sqrt(), sum(), cos(), tan() with angles in degrees.",
      "source: UNIQUBE = decided by UNIQUBE; PROPOSED = default to be confirmed; SUPPLIER = replace with supplier data."
